  "body": "All form parts: https://deploy-preview-1755--base-ui.netlify.app/experiments/form\r\n\r\n- Fixes #1745 \u2014 `onClearErrors` was not integrated with Base UI components\r\n- Fixes #1758 \u2014 `Select` was missing `useField` integration\r\n- Now with native validation, it will commit any revalidation on change, matching the revalidation of the controlled `errors` prop\r\n\r\nMoved `Field` tests to each individual component suite, much easier to see what is being tested for each Base UI component",
