   "body": "I think it would feel more responsive if the errors were cleared on change (or for the validation to re-run on change) even when `validationMode=\"onBlur\"` - https://www.smashingmagazine.com/2022/09/inline-validation-web-forms-ux/#4-reward-early-punish-late\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88867abe-5be7-4d30-bffe-f0baca5824ce\r\n\r\n(RHF lets you separately configure re-validation mode: https://react-hook-form.com/docs/useform#reValidateMode)",
