   "body": "It works pretty good now, though I agree revalidation needs more thought (providing configurability vs being opinionated about the UX, maybe we could be opinionated because we don't have to be as flexible as a general form lib)\r\n\r\nOne thing (that I think can be done in a separate PR) is maybe only revalidate `required` on change, so the user isn't scolded by another error before finishing typing (but it's much better than feeling unresponsive) @atomiks \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bb01abe2-9c6d-4163-924d-96f326c34758\r\n",
